--- stdout ---
Usage: xray strategy [options] [command]

Manage strategies (list, create, install, remove, enable, disable, info)

COMMANDS:
  list [--flags]              List all available strategies
  detect [--flags]            Detect applicable strategies for the current
                              project
  info <name> [--flags]       Show detailed information about a strategy
  create <name> [--flags]     Create a new strategy scaffold
  install <source> [--flags]  Install a strategy from a path or npm package
  remove <name> [--flags]     Remove an installed strategy (asks first; scripts
                              pass --confirm=yes)
  validate <name> [--flags]   Validate a strategy file
  path [--flags]              Show strategy search paths

FLAGS:
  -h, --help                  Display help


--- stderr ---
"
`;

